nd the world](#Locations_around_the_world)\n* [5 Security concerns and controversies](#Security_concerns_and_controversies)\n  + [5.1 Restatement](#Restatement)\n  + [5.2 Endpoint bug](#Endpoint_bug)\n  + [5.3 Scan evasion vulnerability](#Scan_evasion_vulnerability)\n  + [5.4 Denial-of-service attack vulnerabilities](#Denial-of-service_attack_vulnerabilities)\n  + [5.5 Scareware lawsuit](#Scareware_lawsuit)\n  + [5.6 Source code theft](#Source_code_theft)\n  + [5.7 Verisign data breach](#Verisign_data_breach)\n  + [5.8 pcAnywhere exploit](#pcAnywhere_exploit)\n  + [5.9 Hacking of *The New York Times* network](#Hacking_of_The_New_York_Times_network)\n  + [5.10 Intellectual Ventures suit](#Intellectual_Ventures_suit)\n  + [5.11 Sustaining digital certificate security](#Sustaining_digital_certificate_security)\n  + [5.12 Google and Symantec clash on website security checks](#Google_and_Symantec_clash_on_website_security_checks)\n  + [5.13 Norton Crypto](#Norton_Crypto)\n  + [5.14 Columbia patent-infringement lawsuit](#Columbia_patent-infringement_lawsuit)\n  + [5.15 TCPA class action settlement](#TCPA_class_action_settlement)\n* [6 Logos](#Logos)\n* [7 See also](#See_also)\n* [8 References](#References)\n* [9 External links](#External_links)\n\n# Gen Digital\n\n* [العربية](https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%AC%D9%8A%D9%86_%D8%AF%D9%8A%D8%AC%D9%8A%D8%AA%D8%A7%D9%84 \"جين ديجيتال – Arabic\")\n* [تۆرکجه](https://azb.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%B3%DB%8C%D9%85%D9%86%D8%AA%DA%A9 \"سیمنتک – South Azerbaijani\")\n* [Български](https://bg.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symantec \"Symantec – Bulgarian\")\n* [Català](https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/NortonLifeLock \"NortonLifeLock – Catalan\")\n* [Čeština](https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gen_Digital \"Gen Digital – Czech\")\n* [Dansk](https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symantec \"Symantec – Danish\")\n* [Deutsch](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gen_Digital \"Gen Digital – German\")\n* [Esperanto](https://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symantec \"Symantec – Esperanto\"